usive.   The Students (Index) view should be sortable ascending and descending according to the LastName column or the GPA column. ","topics":[],"score":229808,"global_rank":112967},{"name":"MollsReis/nsqfun","owner":"MollsReis","html_url":"https://github.com/MollsReis/nsqfun","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"NSQ Fun","topics":["docker-compose","map-reduce","nodejs","nsq","nsqd"],"score":229794,"global_rank":112983},{"name":"mccarthydev/coloredbalz","owner":"mccarthydev","html_url":"https://github.com/mccarthydev/coloredbalz","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"My first javascript game, you have 5 seconds to memorize the colors of the balls. Score more and more in each turn","topics":[],"score":229794,"global_rank":112985},{"name":"kwokwilliam/RPiWebControl","owner":"kwokwilliam","html_url":"https://github.com/kwokwilliam/RPiWebControl","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Created for UW iGEM 2018/Experimentation","topics":[],"score":229794,"global_rank":112986},{"name":"symblai/docusaurus-plugin-munchkin","owner":"symblai","html_url":"https://github.com/symblai/docusaurus-plugin-munchkin","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":2,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Plugin which adds Marketo Munchkin script to docusaurus","topics":[],"score":229784,"global_rank":112994},{"name":"junlee91/netflix-clone","owner":"junlee91","html_url":"https://github.com/junlee91/netflix-clone","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Cloning Netflix with VanillaJS, CSS Grid and Webpack [Nomad Coders]","topics":[],"score":229781,"global_rank":112998},{"name":"masonJamesWheeler/fieldflowtwo","owner":"masonJamesWheeler","html_url":"https://github.com/masonJamesWheeler/fieldflowtwo","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":1,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":229778,"global